1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,460
Aur 'Contributor Day' ka matlab bhi pata nahi hota.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:05,150
Volunteer karna hai? apna rasta bhi mil jaata hai.

3
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:07,550
CampBuddy tumhe ek chhoti si checklist deta hai.

4
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:10,290
'Kisi doosre shehar wale se milo' — ek task.

5
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:12,590
'Sponsor area ghoom aao' — ek aur task.

6
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:16,580
Sponsors ke offers aur unki jaankari ek hi jagah dikh jaate hain.

7
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:20,510
Sab kuch bilkul free — campbuddy.club pe try karo.
